WEBVTT

01:26.490 --> 01:29.770
[Glory]

01:30.620 --> 01:32.930
[Episode 23]

01:40.590 --> 01:41.640
I, Lu Jianglai,

01:41.759 --> 01:43.759
pay my respects to Your Excellency.

01:44.640 --> 01:45.700
What is this about?

01:45.950 --> 01:47.479
You've come at the right time.

01:47.479 --> 01:48.880
I have a question for you.

01:49.710 --> 01:51.430
Open it. Show it to Lord Lu.

01:54.000 --> 01:55.150
Weren't all the Yang family members

01:55.150 --> 01:56.550
imprisoned and charged?

01:56.680 --> 01:58.140
How is he the only one left?

01:58.509 --> 02:00.000
And he specifically came to my office

02:00.000 --> 02:01.150
trying to bribe me.

02:01.710 --> 02:03.040
Look at this.

02:05.680 --> 02:06.590
Your Excellency, please forgive me.

02:06.590 --> 02:07.790
It was my negligence.

02:07.870 --> 02:09.030
I will take him back

02:09.030 --> 02:10.300
and interrogate him thoroughly.

02:10.300 --> 02:11.500
Come, carry him away.

02:15.800 --> 02:17.130
Take all the bribe money

02:17.680 --> 02:19.870
to the Prefect's office

02:19.870 --> 02:21.130
and seal it in storage.

02:21.560 --> 02:22.000
Yes.

02:26.470 --> 02:28.430
Lord Lu, why?

02:29.590 --> 02:31.790
Did you come specifically confront me,

02:32.120 --> 02:33.520
or to check whether I

02:33.630 --> 02:34.710
have taken bribes

02:35.590 --> 02:37.050
to pardon the Yang family?

02:37.520 --> 02:39.579
Your Excellency, I would never dare.

02:40.079 --> 02:42.940
Since entering
the Provincial Governor's Office,

02:43.000 --> 02:45.590
I ordered all rooms to be closed

02:45.910 --> 02:46.910
except for three?

02:47.400 --> 02:49.240
one for my wife and me

02:49.240 --> 02:50.190
to live in,

02:50.630 --> 02:53.360
another to care for my mother,

02:54.310 --> 02:55.240
and the last

02:56.030 --> 02:58.000
a study for receiving guests.

02:58.680 --> 03:00.080
In my 30 years of service,

03:00.310 --> 03:01.910
I've never kept maids or taken concubines.

03:01.910 --> 03:03.240
And I have no children.

03:03.800 --> 03:05.460
The most valuable things I own

03:05.800 --> 03:07.120
are the ancient books

03:07.400 --> 03:08.860
and paintings in my study,

03:09.030 --> 03:11.310
most bestowed by His Majesty.

03:11.960 --> 03:14.520
Ten years ago, as Prefect of Linji,

03:14.910 --> 03:16.970
the Wei case was sent to me for review.

03:17.000 --> 03:17.960
I dismissed

03:18.430 --> 03:20.470
Fan Wende who conducted the initial trial,

03:20.470 --> 03:23.070
and later appointed Xu Song
to handle the case.

03:23.310 --> 03:25.190
I also reported the case

03:25.470 --> 03:28.150
and requested His Majesty
to execute Wei Kejian.

03:28.150 --> 03:29.520
But I have never accepted

03:29.520 --> 03:30.840
even a penny in bribes.

03:31.240 --> 03:33.770
Every judgment
was based on law and evidence.

03:34.079 --> 03:36.079
My heart is upright,
my conduct irreproachable;

03:36.079 --> 03:37.880
I have never feared idle gossip.

03:39.470 --> 03:40.910
Your Excellency speaks too gravely.

03:40.910 --> 03:42.510
I would never dare doubt you.

03:42.910 --> 03:43.470
However,

03:44.430 --> 03:45.840
I still dare to ask:

03:46.590 --> 03:47.910
since the case is closed,

03:47.910 --> 03:49.190
when will Fan Wende, Yu Cheng,

03:49.190 --> 03:50.990
Huang Guangzong, and Yan Ruhai,

03:51.000 --> 03:52.870
the officials imprisoned
over the Wei family case,

03:52.870 --> 03:54.520
be released without charges

03:54.910 --> 03:56.770
and restored to their positions?

03:57.960 --> 03:59.620
Those incompetent officials

03:59.710 --> 04:01.430
who delayed the case
and neglected their duties

04:01.430 --> 04:02.950
couldn't even judge the case clearly,

04:02.950 --> 04:04.870
leaving troubles that persist to this day.

04:04.870 --> 04:06.600
I intend to request His Majesty

04:06.750 --> 04:08.150
to punish them severely.

04:09.120 --> 04:11.400
Your Excellency,
during this time of celebration,

04:11.400 --> 04:12.710
with His Majesty's birthday
and the Longevity Festival approaching,

04:12.710 --> 04:14.280
even the Government Office's
suspending criminal proceedings.

04:14.280 --> 04:15.910
Please show mercy

04:16.269 --> 04:17.800
and handle them leniently.

04:23.000 --> 04:24.880
It's rare to find someone
as magnanimous as you,

04:24.880 --> 04:26.310
willing to plead for them.

04:26.310 --> 04:28.390
I'm not heartless.

04:28.950 --> 04:30.430
If there's an opportunity in the future,

04:30.430 --> 04:31.830
I may consider leniency.

04:32.600 --> 04:33.430
If Linji had more

04:33.430 --> 04:34.750
pillars like you,

04:35.430 --> 04:37.230
there would be no unsolved cases

04:37.270 --> 04:38.800
or unredressed injustice.

04:39.040 --> 04:41.680
In a few days, I'll go to the capital
for the celebration.

04:41.680 --> 04:43.080
I will speak highly of you

04:43.310 --> 04:44.440
before His Majesty.

04:45.120 --> 04:45.950
Rest assured.

04:47.830 --> 04:49.360
Thank you for your support.

05:13.190 --> 05:14.250
Don't touch my tea!

05:16.070 --> 05:17.510
What's wrong with Lady Yunyin?

05:17.510 --> 05:18.440
What's going on?

05:18.480 --> 05:19.240
No idea.

05:19.510 --> 05:20.240
Give it to me.

05:21.310 --> 05:23.070
Give it to me!

05:23.830 --> 05:24.630
Lady Shanbao,

05:24.750 --> 05:26.480
look, they're fighting again.

05:27.480 --> 05:28.160
Let go!

05:38.390 --> 05:40.240
Shanbao! Shanbao!

05:40.600 --> 05:42.530
Yunyin's mean. She's bullying me!

05:45.440 --> 05:45.960
Wanwan,

05:47.390 --> 05:49.250
did you pick tea buds recklessly?

05:49.530 --> 05:51.600
Go apologize to Yunyin.

05:53.659 --> 05:54.180
Go now.

05:57.360 --> 05:57.950
Wanwan.

06:03.480 --> 06:04.430
Now even Shanbao

06:04.430 --> 06:05.830
doesn't love me anymore.

06:05.920 --> 06:07.360
I don't want to stay here.

06:07.360 --> 06:08.630
I'm going to find Ms. Liang.

06:08.630 --> 06:10.160
I'm going to find Ms. Liang!

06:10.680 --> 06:11.630
The tea plantation is no place

06:11.630 --> 06:12.830
for children to play.

06:13.240 --> 06:14.700
I've spoiled you too much.

06:15.600 --> 06:18.060
Xiu Qiong, take Lady Yunwan
back to her room.

06:18.120 --> 06:19.250
She may come out only

06:19.360 --> 06:20.920
when she's willing to apologize.

06:20.920 --> 06:21.510
Lady Yunwan.

06:21.510 --> 06:22.600
-Lady Yunwan, let's go.
-Shanbao.

06:22.600 --> 06:23.130
Shanbao,

06:23.630 --> 06:24.510
I'll never pick recklessly again.

06:24.510 --> 06:25.240
Lady Yunwan.

06:25.430 --> 06:26.680
-I won't be naughty anymore.
-Let's go.

06:26.680 --> 06:27.480
Shanbao!

06:28.560 --> 06:29.310
You always

06:29.310 --> 06:30.720
side with that silly girl,

06:30.720 --> 06:32.120
and it's always my fault.

06:32.190 --> 06:34.850
If I don't give in to her,
I'll be punished badly.

06:34.920 --> 06:36.920
Did the sun rise from the west today?

06:37.920 --> 06:40.650
Your crooked heart
is finally straight for once.

06:41.409 --> 06:43.610
As if anyone cares—you biased

06:44.310 --> 06:45.070
hypocrite.

06:45.750 --> 06:46.270
Stop.

06:48.560 --> 06:50.690
Have you finished your work for today?

06:51.230 --> 06:52.000
Come with me.

07:23.310 --> 07:25.310
These chicken-claw branches
need to be trimmed cleanly.

07:25.310 --> 07:26.650
Make the cuts clean and sharp

07:26.650 --> 07:28.310
so the canopy surface stays even.

07:28.310 --> 07:29.840
Understood, Lady Shanbao.

07:30.360 --> 07:32.000
Everyone, work efficiently!

07:32.000 --> 07:33.450
All these tea trees must be trimmed today!

07:33.450 --> 07:34.580
Okay. Go over there.

07:39.310 --> 07:40.510
I have some over here.

07:43.600 --> 07:44.390
The tender branches

07:44.390 --> 07:45.650
need to be cut back more

07:45.830 --> 07:47.510
so they'll sprout better next year.

07:47.510 --> 07:48.270
Yes.

07:48.830 --> 07:49.560
Give it to me.

08:02.510 --> 08:03.950
-Lady Shanbao, be careful!
-Watch out!

08:03.950 --> 08:04.720
The ox is startled!

08:04.720 --> 08:05.920
Careful!

08:06.510 --> 08:07.480
-Don't get hurt!
-Watch out!

08:07.480 --> 08:08.480
Get away quickly!

08:34.360 --> 08:35.789
Lady Shanbao's amazing.

08:37.730 --> 08:38.530
Lady Shanbao.

08:39.000 --> 08:39.650
Take it away.

08:39.650 --> 08:40.200
Yes.

08:56.320 --> 08:58.310
During seasons
when camel caravans can't travel,

08:58.310 --> 09:00.270
the northern route
relies on ox carts to transport tea.

09:00.270 --> 09:01.510
Our Lady Shanbao can

09:01.510 --> 09:03.150
handle six or seven ox carts on her own—

09:03.150 --> 09:04.720
what kind of situation hasn't she seen?

09:04.720 --> 09:06.580
You even know how to control oxen?

09:06.790 --> 09:08.650
I learned from the local experts.

09:08.910 --> 09:10.110
I'll teach you later.

09:10.970 --> 09:11.780
I won't learn.

09:12.400 --> 09:14.520
No, you must learn.

09:15.360 --> 09:17.240
You've been expelled
from the Rong family by Grandmother.

09:17.240 --> 09:19.360
You'll no longer
have fine clothes and delicious food

09:19.360 --> 09:21.220
or servants at your beck and call.

09:21.840 --> 09:23.480
The tea plantation doesn't keep idlers.

09:23.480 --> 09:24.810
If you want to stay here,

09:24.840 --> 09:27.000
you need to start
with the most basic work.

09:27.000 --> 09:28.630
Besides cultivating and processing tea,

09:28.630 --> 09:30.910
you must also
learn various local dialects.

09:30.910 --> 09:31.390
Yi,

09:32.120 --> 09:33.750
get Manager Qiao to come tomorrow

09:33.750 --> 09:35.670
to teach her how
to judge horses and find water sources.

09:35.670 --> 09:36.730
Yes, Lady Shanbao.

09:38.140 --> 09:38.790
Are you really making me

09:38.790 --> 09:40.120
go with the tea caravan?

09:44.550 --> 09:45.480
I won't learn it.

09:46.000 --> 09:47.530
I already know everything.

09:47.550 --> 09:49.360
If you can lead the team back safely,

09:49.360 --> 09:49.870
so can I.

09:52.240 --> 09:53.370
Do you know what food

09:53.670 --> 09:55.720
gives people
the most strength in the desert?

09:55.720 --> 09:57.250
How to feed dogs and camels?

09:57.630 --> 09:58.720
What to do when you encounter

09:58.720 --> 10:00.080
poisonous snakes or desert bandits?

10:00.080 --> 10:00.910
How to survive

10:01.200 --> 10:02.460
in a raging sandstorm?

10:03.030 --> 10:04.600
How to identify fake ginseng?

10:04.600 --> 10:06.030
How to select quality furs?

10:06.030 --> 10:06.960
Can you tell the weight of a sheep

10:06.960 --> 10:08.420
just by touching its back?

10:08.470 --> 10:10.270
You haven't even seen a travel pass.

10:10.270 --> 10:11.800
Apart from arguing with me,

10:11.840 --> 10:13.300
what do you actually know?

10:13.440 --> 10:15.080
Either do the work or get out.

10:15.630 --> 10:17.230
No one here will indulge you.

10:17.540 --> 10:19.380
Yi, let's go ahead and check.

10:23.000 --> 10:23.730
Lady Yunyin,

10:24.240 --> 10:25.270
once your sister enters the plantation,

10:25.270 --> 10:26.240
she becomes a tyrant.

10:26.240 --> 10:27.790
She always stands by her word

10:27.790 --> 10:30.120
and truly won't feed those who don't work.

10:31.200 --> 10:32.000
Lady Shanbao,

10:32.200 --> 10:33.750
the stable manure
and bean cakes are ready,

10:33.750 --> 10:35.610
and the straw has been delivered.

10:43.080 --> 10:43.720
If we can finish

10:43.720 --> 10:45.030
cleaning up the back area today,

10:45.030 --> 10:46.120
-it's almost done.
-Yeah.

10:46.120 --> 10:47.380
-Good.
-That's right.

10:47.440 --> 10:47.750
Don't worry.

10:47.750 --> 10:48.870
If it's not enough, have two more bowls.

10:48.870 --> 10:49.750
After a long day's work,

10:49.750 --> 10:50.910
all I look forward to is this hot meal.

10:50.910 --> 10:52.240
Thank you, Lady Shanbao.

10:52.240 --> 10:52.600
Have more.

10:52.600 --> 10:53.730
Try this tofu today—

10:53.840 --> 10:55.200
it's fried especially well.

10:55.200 --> 10:56.060
Have some more.

10:56.270 --> 10:56.720
Here.

10:57.630 --> 10:58.960
It's really delicious.

11:33.080 --> 11:33.940
I don't want it.

11:43.910 --> 11:44.910
Stop right there!

11:49.840 --> 11:50.630
Don't think that by doing this,

11:50.630 --> 11:52.290
I'll remember your kindness.

11:52.790 --> 11:53.480
I hate you.

11:54.550 --> 11:55.550
I hate you so much!

11:56.870 --> 11:58.270
The Rong family's wealth

11:58.600 --> 12:00.000
didn't fall from the sky.

12:01.200 --> 12:02.710
Back in our
great-grandmother's generation,

12:02.710 --> 12:04.240
some people sought comfort

12:04.390 --> 12:06.430
and entrusted the tea caravans
to chief managers.

12:06.430 --> 12:08.090
As a result, within ten years,

12:08.270 --> 12:09.800
those once-loyal managers

12:10.360 --> 12:12.000
either started their own businesses

12:12.000 --> 12:13.600
or conspired to seize power.

12:14.270 --> 12:16.390
For generations,
the Rong women have been in charge.

12:16.390 --> 12:18.190
If they step back even slightly,

12:18.360 --> 12:20.150
their descendants would be left with

12:20.150 --> 12:21.870
just 20% of the annual profits to live on.

12:21.870 --> 12:23.960
How could they ever
fulfill the ancestors' glory

12:23.960 --> 12:25.360
and build a land of peace?

12:26.630 --> 12:28.840
Traveling with the tea caravans
along the borders,

12:28.840 --> 12:31.040
I witnessed that all kinds of downfalls

12:31.120 --> 12:33.250
stemmed from internal family strife.

12:33.840 --> 12:34.510
That's why

12:36.030 --> 12:37.960
every time you argued with Wanwan,

12:39.000 --> 12:39.910
I punished you.

12:41.360 --> 12:42.960
You hate me for being unfair,

12:43.380 --> 12:44.260
but you forget

12:45.600 --> 12:47.600
I'm only three years older than you.

12:49.080 --> 12:50.340
The year I took charge,

12:50.940 --> 12:52.400
I was still a child myself.

12:53.510 --> 12:55.120
Grandmother taught me business,

12:55.120 --> 12:56.240
but nobody told me

12:57.840 --> 12:59.120
that the first time you plunge a blade

12:59.120 --> 13:00.380
into a bandit's chest,

13:01.720 --> 13:03.920
warm blood would splash into your eyes.

13:04.790 --> 13:06.050
In the dead of night...

13:09.840 --> 13:10.790
I get scared too.

13:14.120 --> 13:14.920
And of course,

13:15.840 --> 13:16.720
no one taught me

13:16.720 --> 13:17.920
how to be your sister.

13:18.590 --> 13:19.160
So,

13:20.720 --> 13:21.840
I could never be

13:22.620 --> 13:24.080
the loving, gentle sister

13:24.390 --> 13:25.650
you want in your heart.

13:26.890 --> 13:27.720
But I will be

13:27.720 --> 13:29.780
a fair and just head of the household.

13:43.400 --> 13:45.830
[Rong Mansion]

14:29.960 --> 14:31.620
I've called you all here today

14:31.790 --> 14:33.910
to celebrate wonderful news.

14:37.790 --> 14:38.360
Yunshu.

14:53.910 --> 14:54.870
Didn't the doctor say

14:54.870 --> 14:57.000
that Yunshu's eye condition was improving?

14:57.000 --> 14:58.670
Why is she using medicine again?

14:58.670 --> 15:02.200
Every year in late autumn and early winter
when the fog is heavy,

15:02.960 --> 15:03.960
Yunshu's eyes

15:03.960 --> 15:06.390
always become mysteriously
sensitive to light and tear up.

15:06.390 --> 15:09.320
She often covers them
with a cloth to block the light.

15:09.440 --> 15:11.570
Are you feeling uncomfortable again?

15:12.630 --> 15:13.920
Take it off quickly.

15:18.010 --> 15:18.730
Let me do it.

15:46.510 --> 15:48.670
You... you can see?

15:51.030 --> 15:52.090
Cousin Xiangling,

15:52.470 --> 15:53.800
are you wearing

15:54.000 --> 15:55.330
scarlet clothes today?

15:56.790 --> 15:58.430
Yes, it is scarlet.

15:59.120 --> 16:00.380
You really can see now.

16:01.320 --> 16:02.380
That's wonderful.

16:02.510 --> 16:03.630
Yunshu's eyes

16:03.870 --> 16:05.670
get better and worse intermittently.

16:05.670 --> 16:06.750
When she was 12,

16:07.240 --> 16:09.170
she could still see distant views,

16:09.420 --> 16:11.960
which means she wasn't born blind.

16:12.430 --> 16:13.700
That Doctor Sun

16:14.360 --> 16:16.220
truly lives up to his reputation.

16:16.720 --> 16:19.250
He cures eye diseases
with remarkable skill.

16:20.730 --> 16:22.490
If we had gone to him earlier,

16:23.080 --> 16:24.670
those quacks wouldn't have

16:25.150 --> 16:27.030
delayed Yunshu's treatment.

16:27.510 --> 16:29.910
Has someone been sent
to deliver the news to the academy?

16:29.910 --> 16:31.030
Such good news.

16:31.440 --> 16:33.000
Mr. Bai will be overjoyed.

16:33.550 --> 16:36.350
I've already sent someone
to deliver the message.

16:38.000 --> 16:40.440
How long has
your eye condition been treated?

16:40.440 --> 16:41.240
Yunshu, you

16:41.240 --> 16:42.370
just think too much.

16:43.160 --> 16:44.720
We all live under the same roof,

16:44.720 --> 16:46.630
yet you kept your sisters in the dark.

16:46.630 --> 16:48.630
Why couldn't you tell us about this?

16:51.790 --> 16:52.870
Dr. Sun explained

16:52.970 --> 16:55.400
that I had accidentally
ingested cat's eye herb as a child.

16:55.400 --> 16:57.200
He said I would need
daily acupuncture to clear the toxins,

16:57.200 --> 16:58.260
take Shenqu pills,

16:58.720 --> 16:59.630
switch to a diet

16:59.630 --> 17:01.430
of black beans and goji berries,

17:01.630 --> 17:03.290
and use medicinal eye washes.

17:03.500 --> 17:06.349
Only by persisting with this treatment
for half a year could I see results.

17:06.349 --> 17:08.030
I was afraid of disappointing Grandmother,

17:08.030 --> 17:09.359
so I kept quiet about it.

17:10.000 --> 17:11.750
Thankfully, heaven took pity on me.

17:11.750 --> 17:13.480
Yesterday after acupuncture,

17:13.640 --> 17:16.030
I suddenly felt
a brightness before my eyes

17:16.030 --> 17:16.829
and immediately

17:16.829 --> 17:18.480
sent someone to inform Grandmother.

17:18.480 --> 17:21.400
This is heaven rewarding
your kindness and filial piety

17:21.400 --> 17:23.069
with special favor.

17:25.589 --> 17:27.400
Before, when you couldn't see,

17:28.700 --> 17:30.830
I thought of having you handle affairs

17:31.350 --> 17:33.480
but worried it might be inconvenient.

17:33.640 --> 17:36.000
Now I can rest easy.

17:36.880 --> 17:38.410
Everyone, please sit down.

17:47.720 --> 17:49.590
Were these really picked by monkeys?

17:49.590 --> 17:50.830
If I hadn't seen it with my own eyes,

17:50.830 --> 17:52.280
I wouldn't have believed it either.

17:52.280 --> 17:53.510
It's a pity tea trees need to rest

17:53.510 --> 17:54.830
after Frost's Descent,

17:54.830 --> 17:56.550
otherwise we could harvest more.

17:56.550 --> 17:58.200
Lord Lu is truly capable,

17:58.440 --> 17:59.720
even the wild animals on the mountain

17:59.720 --> 18:00.920
follow his commands.

18:01.180 --> 18:02.730
Lady Shanbao, he also sent people

18:02.730 --> 18:04.200
to deliver wild tea seeds,

18:04.680 --> 18:05.920
saying our deeply plowed soil

18:05.920 --> 18:07.110
won't grow wild tea well

18:07.110 --> 18:07.680
and specifically advised

18:07.680 --> 18:09.340
sowing them in the mountains.

18:10.310 --> 18:11.570
Don't say that. Don't.

18:11.790 --> 18:13.850
What's wrong? Is your eye twitching?

18:17.590 --> 18:19.630
Have someone divide the tea seeds in half.

18:19.630 --> 18:21.360
Sow one half in the plantation,

18:21.480 --> 18:23.510
the other half
in the wild land behind the mountain.

18:23.510 --> 18:25.400
Assign people to weed and fertilize.

18:25.400 --> 18:27.030
Whether they'll grow well or not,

18:27.030 --> 18:28.090
we'll know in time.

18:30.680 --> 18:31.480
Lady Shanbao,

18:31.510 --> 18:32.240
could you please help

18:32.240 --> 18:32.960
ask Lord Lu?

18:33.270 --> 18:35.030
Those mountain monkeys
are wild and hard to tame.

18:35.030 --> 18:37.160
How did he train them
to be so obedient?

18:37.400 --> 18:38.110
Lady Shanbao,

18:38.110 --> 18:39.910
can monkeys find wild tea trees?

18:41.070 --> 18:41.800
I don't know.

18:42.110 --> 18:43.240
Go ask him yourself.

18:46.720 --> 18:47.960
This is a good thing.

18:48.160 --> 18:49.930
Why did she suddenly get upset?

19:00.110 --> 19:02.590
Yunshu, starting tomorrow,

19:03.000 --> 19:04.590
follow me and focus on learning

19:04.590 --> 19:06.450
how to manage the tea plantation.

19:06.930 --> 19:08.660
I want to show that ungrateful,

19:08.880 --> 19:10.550
arrogant person that

19:11.160 --> 19:14.680
the prosperity of a family is not
the achievement of a single individual.

19:14.680 --> 19:16.410
The Rong family has plenty of

19:16.430 --> 19:17.900
intelligent, filial granddaughters—

19:17.900 --> 19:20.940
losing any one is no great loss.

19:33.920 --> 19:34.780
What happened?

19:37.920 --> 19:39.960
Grandmother, I was careless

19:40.150 --> 19:41.750
and knocked over the teacup.

19:43.360 --> 19:44.290
Don't be afraid.

19:44.890 --> 19:46.750
No wonder I don't like her father.

19:47.200 --> 19:48.640
Such a fine girl,

19:49.270 --> 19:50.920
raised by him to be so timid,

19:51.880 --> 19:53.540
cowardly, and ill-mannered—

19:54.200 --> 19:56.640
nothing like a Rong young lady.

19:58.000 --> 19:58.640
Yunxi,

19:59.550 --> 20:02.010
your daughter
doesn't take after you at all.

20:02.440 --> 20:03.960
She's unlike you.

20:12.590 --> 20:13.390
Grandmother,

20:13.790 --> 20:15.720
Li didn't grow up
in the Rong family

20:15.940 --> 20:18.110
and hasn't learned
the etiquette for tea parties.

20:18.110 --> 20:19.110
It's my fault.

20:19.550 --> 20:20.480
Don't blame Li.

20:21.590 --> 20:23.650
I will teach her properly from now on.

20:24.830 --> 20:26.240
You can't nurture well

20:26.260 --> 20:28.120
a tea seedling with rotten roots.

20:28.350 --> 20:30.070
The child is innocent, after all.

20:30.070 --> 20:31.800
What would a child understand?

20:32.380 --> 20:34.300
You are indeed the one at fault.

20:35.340 --> 20:36.710
A father's character

20:36.820 --> 20:38.270
inevitably influences

20:38.270 --> 20:39.530
his child's behavior.

20:39.720 --> 20:41.430
Trying to correct it later

20:41.880 --> 20:43.540
requires tremendous effort.

20:44.200 --> 20:46.200
You all should take this as a lesson.

20:46.550 --> 20:48.270
Don't get close to any

20:48.270 --> 20:49.330
disreputable men.

21:12.480 --> 21:14.610
Grandmother, Li doesn't know better.

21:15.400 --> 21:17.200
I'm sorry she spoiled your mood.

21:17.200 --> 21:18.460
I'll take her back now.

21:23.400 --> 21:23.990
Well...

21:26.200 --> 21:28.800
I just criticized her a bit,
and she gets upset.

21:29.200 --> 21:30.930
What kind of man did she choose?

21:31.030 --> 21:33.030
An orphan with no proper upbringing

21:33.200 --> 21:35.270
who sells poor-quality tea on the streets.

21:35.270 --> 21:36.800
I just haven't exposed her.

21:37.030 --> 21:38.320
How ungrateful.

21:39.790 --> 21:40.800
Please calm down, Grandmother.

21:40.800 --> 21:42.050
Yunxi didn't mean it.

21:42.400 --> 21:44.260
It's not your place to speak here.

21:53.050 --> 21:54.250
What's going on here?

21:55.680 --> 21:56.590
Every single one of you

21:56.590 --> 21:58.510
can't bear the slightest criticism

21:58.510 --> 22:00.310
and dares to show attitude to me.

22:00.350 --> 22:01.790
I said Li lacks talent.

22:02.270 --> 22:03.870
What part of that isn't true?

22:03.960 --> 22:06.020
She hides from people, always timid.

22:06.110 --> 22:08.110
In what way is she like a Rong young lady?

22:08.110 --> 22:09.240
At her age, Bao

22:09.640 --> 22:10.440
could recite "The Classic of Tea"

22:10.440 --> 22:11.640
from memory.

22:34.240 --> 22:35.830
Don't be angry, Grandmother.

22:35.830 --> 22:37.960
The entire Rong family depends on you.

22:38.160 --> 22:40.830
If you fall ill from anger,
no one can take your place.

22:40.830 --> 22:42.410
If you miss Shanbao,

22:42.830 --> 22:44.230
I'll go invite her again.

22:44.920 --> 22:46.240
Even if I have to beg on my knees,

22:46.240 --> 22:47.480
I'll bring her back.

22:47.830 --> 22:49.180
Who said I miss her?

22:50.880 --> 22:52.810
That disobedient, unfilial girl.

22:52.880 --> 22:53.960
I will never allow her to step foot

22:53.960 --> 22:55.090
in this house again.

22:56.680 --> 22:58.810
But the tea caravan is about to depart,

22:59.310 --> 23:01.840
and the tea plantation
still needs managing.

23:02.110 --> 23:04.370
There must be someone capable in charge.

23:09.590 --> 23:11.000
Then I'll have you

23:11.350 --> 23:13.480
go with the tea caravan
to the border town.

23:13.480 --> 23:15.940
You've traveled this road
many times before.

23:15.940 --> 23:18.210
With you going, I am at ease.

23:21.270 --> 23:23.270
As for the tea plantation and shops,

23:23.350 --> 23:25.350
the old managers are already there,

23:25.830 --> 23:27.890
so there won't be any major problems.

23:28.880 --> 23:30.510
Just have Guanyu keep an eye on things.

23:30.510 --> 23:31.790
If anything serious happens,

23:31.790 --> 23:33.650
come back and ask for my decision.

23:34.110 --> 23:34.680
Yes.

23:35.660 --> 23:37.440
Alright, I'm tired now.

23:37.790 --> 23:38.790
You may all leave.

23:51.640 --> 23:52.310
Old Madam.

23:52.680 --> 23:54.480
I've been by your side every day.

23:54.550 --> 23:56.590
Now I suddenly have
to go to the border town.

23:56.590 --> 23:57.830
With no one by your side,

23:57.830 --> 23:59.160
I'm truly worried.

23:59.810 --> 24:01.550
I'm as tough as nails.

24:02.270 --> 24:04.070
Even heaven can't knock me down.

24:08.350 --> 24:09.550
You've had a long day.

24:10.160 --> 24:11.400
Go back and rest early.

24:11.400 --> 24:13.060
No need to keep watch tonight.

24:25.680 --> 24:26.410
Who's there?

24:26.740 --> 24:27.260
It's me.

24:30.830 --> 24:33.110
Lady Shanbao, you're so busy
being angry with me

24:33.110 --> 24:35.840
that you've forgotten
about Madam Yang's death?

24:39.350 --> 24:40.610
Didn't the coroner say

24:41.110 --> 24:42.240
she hanged herself?

24:42.680 --> 24:44.350
That might be able to fool others.

24:44.350 --> 24:46.110
But you are so sharp-witted, Lady Shanbao.

24:46.110 --> 24:48.170
What could possibly be kept from you?

24:48.440 --> 24:50.900
For 10 years,
Madam Yang lived in anonymity,

24:51.790 --> 24:53.440
willingly enduring
public scorn and rejection

24:53.440 --> 24:54.370
just to survive.

24:54.400 --> 24:56.510
Her spirit was incredibly
resilient and strong.

24:56.510 --> 24:58.200
After patiently waiting to clear her name

24:58.200 --> 24:59.590
and see the light of day again,

24:59.590 --> 25:01.450
how could she simply end her life?

25:01.720 --> 25:02.400
Moreover,

25:02.620 --> 25:04.480
she loved Lady Yunwan
like her own daughter.

25:04.480 --> 25:06.410
How could she abandon her by dying?

25:06.970 --> 25:08.970
She was clearly forced to her death.

25:09.270 --> 25:11.200
You're not as confused as you seem.

25:11.270 --> 25:13.310
If you know something is suspicious,

25:13.310 --> 25:15.440
why haven't you arrested Yang Yitang?

25:15.480 --> 25:17.440
Yang Yitang has already been captured.

25:17.440 --> 25:18.240
But I believe

25:19.440 --> 25:22.170
he's not the one
who drove Madam Yang to her death.

25:22.350 --> 25:22.880
Why not?

25:23.200 --> 25:24.680
Before Madam Yang took her own life,

25:24.680 --> 25:25.880
Yang Yitang was in Linji City,

25:25.880 --> 25:27.400
pulling strings everywhere

25:27.400 --> 25:29.920
and asking officials
to exonerate the Yang family.

25:29.920 --> 25:31.680
It was a matter of life and death.

25:31.680 --> 25:33.590
How could he be in two places at once?

25:33.590 --> 25:34.070
Besides,

25:34.070 --> 25:35.930
I had men guarding the city gates.

25:36.110 --> 25:37.370
He never left the city.

25:37.790 --> 25:39.680
If not him, then who?

25:40.830 --> 25:42.430
The implicated Yang family?

25:42.790 --> 25:44.390
Or someone from the Wei clan?

25:44.600 --> 25:45.400
Rest assured.

25:46.120 --> 25:47.650
I will find the real culprit

25:47.880 --> 25:49.740
and bring justice for Madam Yang.

25:50.640 --> 25:51.310
Justice?

25:52.960 --> 25:53.760
In this world,

25:54.270 --> 25:55.440
for this poor woman,

25:56.110 --> 25:58.170
when has there ever been any justice?

25:58.680 --> 26:00.350
Thank you for telling me, Lord Lu.

26:00.350 --> 26:02.150
It's late. I shouldn't keep you.

26:07.750 --> 26:08.550
Please leave.

26:17.550 --> 26:19.010
We've done with business.

26:19.830 --> 26:20.760
Then I'll leave.

26:26.200 --> 26:27.000
I-I'm really leaving.

26:27.000 --> 26:27.530
Go ahead.

26:31.790 --> 26:33.200
I'm afraid you will have to

26:33.200 --> 26:35.330
stay here for a few days, Lady Shanbao.

26:36.110 --> 26:37.640
What you've lost because of me,

26:37.640 --> 26:38.370
I'll help you

26:38.990 --> 26:40.410
get it all back someday.

26:41.300 --> 26:42.590
What I want,

26:43.590 --> 26:44.920
I'll reclaim myself.

26:58.620 --> 26:59.420
I believe you.

27:00.070 --> 27:01.500
But before you reclaim your glory,

27:01.500 --> 27:02.500
don't ever forget

27:03.000 --> 27:04.490
it was because of me, Lu Jianglai,

27:04.490 --> 27:05.270
that you were kicked out

27:05.270 --> 27:06.270
by Old Madam Rong.

27:06.440 --> 27:07.900
You must hate me every day,

27:08.000 --> 27:08.710
remember me,

27:08.710 --> 27:09.350
and not for a moment

27:09.350 --> 27:10.950
are you allowed to forget me.

27:11.680 --> 27:12.740
Someone's coming.

27:21.550 --> 27:22.350
Lady Shanbao.

27:22.680 --> 27:24.210
Is someone disturbing you?

27:28.440 --> 27:29.240
It's nothing.

27:30.160 --> 27:32.960
Just some wild monkeys
in the mountains causing trouble.

27:32.960 --> 27:35.560
There are wild monkeys
in these tea mountains?

27:36.680 --> 27:38.550
Get two people to guard the entrance.

27:38.550 --> 27:39.410
Yes, of course.

27:39.470 --> 27:41.870
If they come back,
we'll beat them to death.

27:56.220 --> 27:58.160
Li, does this look good?

28:00.070 --> 28:00.930
You can have it.

28:02.980 --> 28:04.030
The reason I kept Li

28:04.030 --> 28:05.560
outside the family mansion

28:05.750 --> 28:07.880
was to prevent this kind of situation.

28:08.180 --> 28:10.160
Grandmother values bloodlines so much

28:10.160 --> 28:12.160
and constantly talks
about family background.

28:12.160 --> 28:13.420
Li would never be happy

28:13.750 --> 28:14.920
in the Rong family.

28:15.880 --> 28:17.740
Li is a daughter of the Rong family

28:17.920 --> 28:20.180
and must eventually return to her roots.

28:20.440 --> 28:21.900
I couldn't sleep all night

28:22.240 --> 28:23.440
thinking about this.

28:24.440 --> 28:25.590
If you were the one

28:26.440 --> 28:28.720
facing Grandmother's harsh questioning,

28:28.720 --> 28:30.790
what would you do, Rong Shanbao?

28:32.280 --> 28:33.680
See if you dare again.

28:39.350 --> 28:40.550
Let's play together.

28:40.590 --> 28:41.550
I want to play with them too.

28:41.550 --> 28:42.160
Careful, Li!

28:42.160 --> 28:42.820
Don't fall.

28:46.640 --> 28:47.400
Let them play together.

28:47.400 --> 28:49.750
-Let go!
-No, I won't!

28:55.120 --> 28:57.600
Yunyin seems like a completely
different person.

28:57.600 --> 28:58.930
I hardly recognize her.

29:00.110 --> 29:01.770
Why didn't you try to stop her?

29:02.440 --> 29:04.040
I used to interfere too much.

29:04.830 --> 29:05.590
I think

29:06.440 --> 29:07.400
Li has

29:07.400 --> 29:08.550
her father's blood,

29:09.400 --> 29:10.400
but she was nurtured

29:10.400 --> 29:11.600
in her mother's womb.

29:12.350 --> 29:15.160
Our ancestors used to say:
"Without rain from the sky,

29:15.160 --> 29:16.690
grass won't grow on earth."

29:16.880 --> 29:18.940
But no matter what kind of rain falls,

29:19.400 --> 29:21.960
sweet, salty, or bitter,

29:22.960 --> 29:24.030
a pine tree seed

29:24.510 --> 29:26.370
will never grow into a cocklebur.

29:26.510 --> 29:27.550
Li, like you and me

29:28.400 --> 29:29.440
and our sisters,

29:30.240 --> 29:32.030
shares the same bloodline

29:32.030 --> 29:33.290
from our Grandmother.

29:34.070 --> 29:36.530
She is destined
to grow into a towering tree.

29:36.830 --> 29:38.160
With proper nurturing,

29:38.510 --> 29:40.400
she will succeed one day.

29:41.390 --> 29:42.320
Why can't you all

29:42.750 --> 29:44.150
be a little more patient?

29:45.510 --> 29:46.400
If only Grandmother were

29:46.400 --> 29:47.680
as open-minded as you.

29:49.750 --> 29:52.030
Perhaps the Rong family needs

29:52.030 --> 29:53.360
a new head of household.

29:56.640 --> 29:57.440
Why?

29:57.590 --> 29:58.520
Let's chase her.

30:02.270 --> 30:03.200
Don't run away!

30:05.680 --> 30:07.480
Li, be careful!

30:07.790 --> 30:08.590
Don't fall!

30:09.750 --> 30:11.110
-Li!
-Lady Yunyin, be careful!

30:11.110 --> 30:11.920
Run slower!

30:12.920 --> 30:13.550
Don't run!

30:14.000 --> 30:15.110
Stop running!

30:17.110 --> 30:17.640
Li!

30:18.160 --> 30:18.890
Look at this!

30:20.640 --> 30:21.900
-I got you.
-Slow down.

30:22.480 --> 30:23.350
That's impressive!

30:23.350 --> 30:25.830
Grandmother ordered Ms. Yan
to escort the tea shipment.

30:25.830 --> 30:27.360
They'll be departing soon.

30:34.590 --> 30:35.480
Wanwan, slow down!

30:35.480 --> 30:36.440
It's my turn!

30:39.310 --> 30:39.770
Come on.

30:40.070 --> 30:41.350
Why are there so many more

30:41.350 --> 30:42.830
mules and horses prepared this year?

30:42.830 --> 30:43.750
When Lady Shanbao left,

30:43.750 --> 30:45.070
she specifically instructed us

30:45.070 --> 30:46.920
that the harvest is poor this year,

30:46.920 --> 30:48.050
and that heavy snow
and strong winds in the north

30:48.050 --> 30:49.400
have made travel difficult.

30:49.400 --> 30:50.750
So we need to prepare more

30:50.750 --> 30:52.080
than in previous years.

30:52.270 --> 30:53.590
We must also take care
with the mules and horses,

30:53.590 --> 30:56.320
as they could perish
on the road in the blizzards.

30:57.200 --> 30:58.310
Lady Shanbao also sent you

30:58.310 --> 30:59.110
some items.

31:02.960 --> 31:03.960
Lady Shanbao said

31:04.070 --> 31:05.930
we'll be gone for several months.

31:06.270 --> 31:07.030
Ms. Yan,

31:07.160 --> 31:09.440
you haven't traveled
the northern route for many years.

31:09.440 --> 31:11.570
The border regions are bitterly cold.

31:11.880 --> 31:13.830
She's worried about your rheumatic legs

31:13.830 --> 31:15.640
and insists you wear these.

31:17.960 --> 31:20.820
Lady Shanbao has always
been the most considerate.

31:23.590 --> 31:24.270
Hurry up!

31:24.330 --> 31:25.260
Yes, right away!

31:54.770 --> 31:59.950
[Rong's Tea House]

31:57.310 --> 31:58.310
These goods need to be

31:58.310 --> 31:59.640
at the dock before dusk.

31:59.640 --> 32:01.040
Be quick about your work.

32:01.110 --> 32:02.160
Yes, understood.

32:02.480 --> 32:03.080
All right.

32:05.590 --> 32:08.030
Tea, in its use, is cooling in nature

32:08.510 --> 32:10.240
and most fitting as a beverage.

32:13.110 --> 32:13.910
Grandmother.

32:19.550 --> 32:20.280
Lady Yunshu.

32:20.720 --> 32:22.070
Grandmother listened
to the tea history for a while,

32:22.070 --> 32:23.000
then said she was tired

32:23.000 --> 32:24.030
and wanted to rest briefly

32:24.030 --> 32:25.290
with no disturbances.

32:25.550 --> 32:27.280
I'll bring her medicine later.

32:27.550 --> 32:28.550
Grandmother just mentioned

32:28.550 --> 32:29.930
a book called "An Account of Tea".

32:29.930 --> 32:30.960
Please, Nianqiao,

32:30.960 --> 32:32.890
go to the library and find it for me.

32:33.880 --> 32:35.310
I'll take care of the medicine.

32:35.310 --> 32:36.200
When Grandmother wakes up,

32:36.200 --> 32:37.160
I'll help her take it.

32:37.160 --> 32:38.090
It's no trouble.

32:38.390 --> 32:38.830
Yes.

32:47.550 --> 32:48.880
The Purple Dragon Lying in Snow
in the west garden

32:48.880 --> 32:49.790
are in full bloom.

32:49.790 --> 32:51.070
Grandmother loves them.

32:51.070 --> 32:53.030
Cut two stems and bring them for the vase.

32:53.030 --> 32:54.950
Then go to Chongxi Hall to get a cloak.

32:54.950 --> 32:55.630
Be quick.

32:55.980 --> 32:56.810
Yes.

33:53.240 --> 33:53.750
Please.

33:56.550 --> 33:58.480
No need to show me the way. You may go.

33:58.480 --> 33:58.920
Yes.

34:48.780 --> 34:50.420
What did you just do?

34:51.920 --> 34:53.480
The medicine was cold and undrinkable,

34:53.480 --> 34:54.480
so I poured it out.

34:54.960 --> 34:56.230
Why did you come back so suddenly

34:56.230 --> 34:57.340
without sending word ahead?

34:57.340 --> 34:58.800
I could have welcomed you.

35:03.110 --> 35:03.970
It's been days.

35:04.140 --> 35:05.310
Why the stern face?

35:06.390 --> 35:07.520
My eyes have healed.

35:07.590 --> 35:08.920
Aren't you happy for me?

35:13.090 --> 35:15.010
I'm happy. Of course I'm happy.

35:16.400 --> 35:17.920
I was so happy that I immediately asked
the academy master for leave

35:17.920 --> 35:19.650
and rushed back without delay.

35:19.760 --> 35:20.890
But I never expected

35:21.840 --> 35:23.070
to see you with my own eyes

35:23.070 --> 35:25.200
switching Old Madam Rong's medicine.

35:25.400 --> 35:27.670
Yunshu, what are you trying to do?

35:28.070 --> 35:29.510
What nonsense are you talking about?

35:29.510 --> 35:30.150
Would I really poison

35:30.150 --> 35:31.280
my own grandmother?

35:32.020 --> 35:33.100
Rong Yunshu!

35:42.150 --> 35:42.840
Old Madam.

35:43.150 --> 35:44.030
This medicinal soup

35:44.030 --> 35:45.750
is similar to the tonic

35:46.000 --> 35:47.000
you usually take.

35:47.440 --> 35:49.960
Nothing was added except
2 herbs for blood circulation,

35:49.960 --> 35:51.490
Chuanxiong and Kudzu root,

35:51.510 --> 35:52.760
and some phlegm-reducing herbs,

35:52.760 --> 35:54.420
Bile Arisaema and Earthworm.

35:54.710 --> 35:56.040
It won't cause any harm?

35:56.670 --> 35:57.360
I have served

35:57.360 --> 35:58.890
under Ms. Yan for many years

35:58.920 --> 36:00.330
and learned much about medicine.

36:00.330 --> 36:01.880
The herbs Lady Yunshu added

36:02.030 --> 36:04.430
will only benefit you
with no side effects.

36:05.880 --> 36:07.630
She wanted me
to switch to Dr. Sun's medicine,

36:07.630 --> 36:08.590
but I refused,

36:08.880 --> 36:11.010
so she took matters into her own hands.

36:11.450 --> 36:13.330
Such an obedient person usually,

36:13.840 --> 36:15.570
where did she get such courage?

36:15.840 --> 36:16.920
Ms. Yan is quite cautious

36:16.920 --> 36:18.520
when prescribing medicine.

36:18.710 --> 36:20.030
When Lady Shanbao was here,

36:20.030 --> 36:23.030
she also often urged you
to change your prescription.

36:25.590 --> 36:27.400
Lady Yunshu was being filial,

36:27.800 --> 36:29.460
though she was somewhat rash.

36:29.630 --> 36:31.360
Please forgive her, Old Madam.

36:31.760 --> 36:33.510
If she truly cared about my health,

36:33.510 --> 36:35.170
why act through someone else?

36:35.550 --> 36:37.410
Her filial piety is clearly fake.

36:38.290 --> 36:39.600
That wicked girl.

36:45.360 --> 36:46.920
Have your studies made you foolish?

36:46.920 --> 36:48.090
Grandmother loves me so much.

36:48.090 --> 36:49.880
I wish her to live a hundred years.

36:49.880 --> 36:51.110
Dr. Sun said

36:51.550 --> 36:53.300
the elderly often
has shortness of breath and palpitations,

36:53.300 --> 36:54.110
with phlegm issues,

36:54.110 --> 36:55.190
and risk of stroke.

36:55.920 --> 36:56.360
Yet she

36:56.360 --> 36:57.480
has been taking tonic soup for years

36:57.480 --> 36:58.550
that doesn't address her condition.

36:58.550 --> 37:00.110
That's why I added a few new herbs.

37:00.110 --> 37:02.480
If you were just
changing the prescription,

37:02.480 --> 37:03.610
why did it secretly?

37:04.480 --> 37:06.280
Would Grandmother listen to me?

37:08.030 --> 37:10.000
The elderly can be terribly stubborn,

37:10.000 --> 37:11.670
always thinking others want to harm them.

37:11.670 --> 37:14.230
She only trusts Ms. Yan
to prescribe medicine.

37:14.230 --> 37:14.960
But Ms. Yan

37:14.960 --> 37:15.960
has gone on a long journey,

37:15.960 --> 37:17.420
so we couldn't rely on her.

37:19.760 --> 37:20.760
If you don't believe me,

37:20.760 --> 37:22.550
the herb residue is still in my room.

37:22.550 --> 37:23.480
We can find Dr. Sun

37:23.480 --> 37:24.680
to verify it himself.

37:27.960 --> 37:30.010
I'm sorry. I was mistaken.

37:35.880 --> 37:37.710
I apologize. I was wrong.

37:38.400 --> 37:39.280
I wronged you.

37:43.800 --> 37:44.670
All right.

37:45.280 --> 37:48.540
I'll be leaving for the capital soon
for the imperial exam,

37:48.670 --> 37:49.840
and we won't see each other

37:49.840 --> 37:51.040
for quite a long time.

37:52.320 --> 37:54.450
Please don't be angry with me anymore.

37:58.880 --> 38:00.740
Let's go see Old Madam Rong first,

38:00.880 --> 38:01.400
and then

38:02.480 --> 38:04.340
I have something nice to give you.

38:19.710 --> 38:20.320
Mr. Yan,

38:20.320 --> 38:22.280
you eavesdropped on
our conversation just now.

38:22.280 --> 38:24.190
Is this how a gentleman should behave?

38:24.190 --> 38:26.280
You two really know
how to pick a place to talk.

38:26.280 --> 38:28.010
If I hadn't happened to pass by,

38:28.550 --> 38:29.400
your secret

38:29.880 --> 38:31.960
would have been overheard by the servants.

38:31.960 --> 38:32.480
Yunshu.

38:33.550 --> 38:35.290
Mr. Yan and I have
a gentlemanly friendship.

38:35.290 --> 38:37.090
He won't speak of this to others.

38:39.510 --> 38:40.840
I was reckless earlier,

38:41.110 --> 38:43.110
and troubled you to watch out for us.

38:43.110 --> 38:43.710
Thank you.

38:44.550 --> 38:45.880
When I arrived just now,

38:45.960 --> 38:46.800
Old Madam Rong was sending people

38:46.800 --> 38:48.920
to look for you everywhere, Lady Yunshu.

38:48.920 --> 38:50.980
Lady Yunshu, you should go to her now.

38:51.190 --> 38:53.100
Thank you for reminding me, Mr. Yan.

38:53.100 --> 38:54.160
I'll go right away.

39:05.000 --> 39:05.960
I think Lady Yunshu

39:05.960 --> 39:08.490
has ulterior motives
and behaves strangely.

39:09.210 --> 39:10.590
Mr. Bai, you should be cautious

39:10.590 --> 39:12.050
when getting close to her.

39:12.320 --> 39:13.920
Otherwise, one day

39:14.510 --> 39:15.710
you might fall victim to her schemes.

39:15.710 --> 39:18.840
She's often looked down upon
because of her background.

39:18.960 --> 39:19.550
After much difficulty,

39:19.550 --> 39:21.510
she's finally gained
Old Madam Rong's favor.

39:21.510 --> 39:23.910
Who knows how much
slander this will bring?

39:25.230 --> 39:27.090
Mr. Yan, you're an honorable man.

39:27.230 --> 39:27.960
You shouldn't believe

39:27.960 --> 39:29.290
those baseless rumors.

39:32.840 --> 39:34.770
Even if everyone speaks ill of her,

39:36.400 --> 39:37.660
I will still trust her.

39:44.400 --> 39:45.190
So stubborn.

39:48.110 --> 39:48.630
My Lord.

39:49.150 --> 39:50.070
After 3 days of interrogation,

39:50.070 --> 39:51.440
Yang Yitang still firmly denies

39:51.440 --> 39:53.440
involvement in the Wei family case.

39:56.510 --> 39:58.040
When the Wei case happened,

39:58.150 --> 39:59.810
he was just an ignorant youth.

40:00.590 --> 40:03.050
It's reasonable for him
to claim ignorance.

40:03.070 --> 40:04.800
Having witnessed his family's misfortune,

40:04.800 --> 40:06.320
he naturally sought help.

40:07.760 --> 40:09.420
If we charge him with bribery,

40:09.670 --> 40:11.670
wouldn't that implicate
Provincial Governor?

40:11.670 --> 40:12.670
However, My Lord,

40:12.840 --> 40:14.230
he falsely accused
Madam Yang of prostitution...

40:14.230 --> 40:15.670
Yang Jisheng has already taken

40:15.670 --> 40:17.200
all the blame upon himself.

40:17.360 --> 40:19.070
You claim Yang Yitang was involved,

40:19.070 --> 40:20.600
but where is your evidence?

40:21.280 --> 40:23.080
Covering up for a close relative

40:23.110 --> 40:25.120
follows the old tradition of filial duty.

40:25.120 --> 40:27.590
Can you really sentence him
to death for that?

40:27.590 --> 40:28.920
So, My Lord, you mean...

40:31.190 --> 40:32.590
An insignificant pawn

40:33.360 --> 40:34.760
should receive 40 lashes

40:35.030 --> 40:37.230
and be released with minor punishment.

40:38.000 --> 40:39.320
My Lord. My Lord.

40:54.360 --> 40:55.820
Young Master, be careful.

41:05.880 --> 41:06.410
Let's go.

41:10.920 --> 41:12.980
Fragrant sachets! Perfume pouches!

41:14.670 --> 41:15.320
Watch out!

41:17.070 --> 41:18.110
Take a look!

41:19.960 --> 41:20.880
Candied haws!

41:21.060 --> 41:21.860
I'll take one.

41:24.440 --> 41:25.760
Young Master, you predicted correctly.

41:25.760 --> 41:27.160
Lord Lu indeed set a trap.

41:27.480 --> 41:28.190
Don't worry.

41:28.190 --> 41:28.630
Someone will

41:28.630 --> 41:30.360
lead away those who are watching us.

41:30.360 --> 41:32.150
I was never openly
involved in the Wei case,

41:32.150 --> 41:33.880
so they can't sentence me to death.

41:33.880 --> 41:34.540
Where is he?

41:35.030 --> 41:36.280
He's on the second floor.

41:36.280 --> 41:38.280
He's been waiting for you for 2 days.

41:39.380 --> 41:39.940
Let's go.

41:52.320 --> 41:53.400
Mr. He.

41:54.190 --> 41:55.450
I've long admired you.

41:56.070 --> 41:57.960
I was delayed by trivial matters.

41:59.310 --> 42:01.110
Please forgive my late arrival.

42:03.000 --> 42:04.230
Skip the pleasantries.

42:04.230 --> 42:05.070
Mr. Yang, you said

42:05.070 --> 42:05.880
you wanted to do

42:05.880 --> 42:07.480
a huge business deal with me.

42:07.510 --> 42:08.640
I took it seriously.

42:09.880 --> 42:12.030
If you've made me
wait 2 days for nothing,

42:12.030 --> 42:13.590
I won't let you off easily.

42:17.510 --> 42:18.110
Good.

42:18.710 --> 42:19.970
Straight to the point.

42:20.510 --> 42:23.190
Previously, the Rong family ruined
your tea contract,

42:23.190 --> 42:25.280
causing you heavy losses.

42:26.110 --> 42:27.800
Don't you want to settle

42:28.320 --> 42:30.120
this score with the Rong family?

42:31.710 --> 42:33.800
Even a mighty dragon
can't defeat a local snake.

42:33.800 --> 42:35.730
You think the Rongs are pushovers?

42:36.030 --> 42:38.150
If you want to die, go ahead by yourself.

42:38.150 --> 42:39.230
Don't drag me down.

42:40.900 --> 42:42.340
Every spring and autumn,

42:42.920 --> 42:44.550
the Rong family has
a large shipment of tea

42:44.550 --> 42:46.400
to be escorted to the border regions.

42:46.400 --> 42:47.920
Their most capable men

42:48.320 --> 42:49.920
are all needed as escorts,

42:50.550 --> 42:52.950
leaving their defenses quite vulnerable.

42:53.070 --> 42:53.800
Mr. He,

42:53.800 --> 42:56.030
you've dominated
the river trade for decades

42:56.030 --> 42:57.880
and never misses a business opportunity.

42:57.880 --> 43:00.610
Would you be willing
to miss such a golden chance?

43:01.400 --> 43:02.760
You're truly arrogant.

43:03.190 --> 43:05.400
The Rong family mansion
is heavily guarded.

43:05.400 --> 43:06.070
The outer courtyard guards

43:06.070 --> 43:07.480
are all top fighters.

43:08.190 --> 43:10.450
You can't just attack whenever you want.

43:14.070 --> 43:15.510
No wonder you've been
lingering near Linji,

43:15.510 --> 43:16.570
refusing to leave.

43:17.280 --> 43:19.340
So you've already scouted the place.

43:19.760 --> 43:20.230
No rush.

43:21.030 --> 43:22.230
I have my own methods.

43:23.110 --> 43:25.590
Please, sit down
and let's discuss the details.

43:25.590 --> 43:26.990
My Lord, I've failed you.

43:27.230 --> 43:28.800
I let that Yang fellow escape.

43:28.800 --> 43:30.320
I understand. Get up.

43:37.320 --> 43:37.920
All right.

43:38.840 --> 43:39.970
What's done is done.

43:40.030 --> 43:41.760
What use is there in regret now?

43:42.760 --> 43:44.510
When you go out on missions in the future,

43:44.510 --> 43:45.710
just be more careful.

43:48.440 --> 43:50.100
As for the bait we've let go...

43:50.840 --> 43:53.400
The Yang family declined
because of the reversal of the Wei case.

43:53.400 --> 43:54.330
This Yang Yitang

43:54.510 --> 43:55.840
won't give up so easily.

43:56.110 --> 43:57.360
My Lord, you're saying...

43:57.360 --> 43:59.090
I expect the one he resents most

43:59.320 --> 44:00.520
is Lady Rong Shanbao.

44:02.030 --> 44:04.360
Have someone monitor the tea plantation.

44:04.510 --> 44:06.310
He will certainly show up again.

44:06.510 --> 44:06.920
Yes, My Lord.
